## The Interior's land

The Interior map's ground (src/share/interior/height.bin) is derived from
ANADEM v1, Laipelt et al. 2024, "ANADEM: A Digital Terrain Model for
South America", Remote Sensing 16(13):2321, doi:10.3390/rs16132321,
ANA / IPH-UFRGS, licensed CC BY 4.0, resampled, turned and edited (a
river channel cut). Its land cover (src/share/interior/land.bin) is
derived from ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200, (c) ESA WorldCover project
2021 / Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2021) processed by
ESA WorldCover consortium, licensed CC BY 4.0, resampled, turned,
filtered and painted over. tools/interior/ builds both.

